SECRET NAMES ONLY
BLOGGER_OAUTH_JSON, BLOGGER_UI_STORAGE_STATE_B64, BLOGGER_BLOG_ID, BLOGGER_URL, BLOGGER_ENABLED, GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON, GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS, GOOGLE_SHEET_URL, GOOGLE_SHEET_ID, GOOGLE_SHEET_RANGE, GEMINI_API_KEY, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, Cloudflare account/token secrets, platform-specific Meta and LinkedIn tokens. Never write their values into docs or logs.

ACCEPTANCE CHECKLIST
- [ ] Quality Check passes all targeted and full offline tests.
- [ ] Image QA differentiates PASS from SKIPPED/ERROR and never fakes scores.
- [ ] One daily slot, Cairo 10:00–22:00, no parity rule.
- [ ] Platform IDs/URLs persist and retries are idempotent.
- [ ] Legal claims trace to current verified sources.
- [ ] Facebook and LinkedIn copies are distinct; LinkedIn B2B path tested on normal and image-repair flows.
- [ ] Exact final image inspected; provenance sidecar retained.
- [ ] Actual Reel inspected: one subtitle box, complete spoken text, correct timing, vertical frame, bounded duration, end card.
- [ ] Telegram delivery ID verified; Shorts ID/URL checked if enabled.
- [ ] Blogger OAuth works after owner-side reauthorization; duplicate-safe publish verified.
- [ ] No secret values in source, docs or logs.

